{"version":1,"content":"<p>在德克薩斯州奧斯汀舉行的一場投資者大會上，優步（Uber）聯合創始人特拉維斯．卡蘭尼克（Travis Kalanick）身穿黑色皮夾克走上台。他身旁是埃隆．馬斯克的密友、長期投資人安東尼奧．格拉西亞斯（Antonio Gracias），他也穿着一件黑色皮夾克。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587076.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:43:54.888054+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:19:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_hash":"27080cb0891b9d9c70c2a50873db01a2e3c790e59ec6bb0b43bfcb1dab08d4f2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}